    {
      "id": "windowed-collection-task-overview",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Implementation Plan",
      "position": {
        "x": -220,
        "y": -420
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 240,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Windowed Collection Browsing\n\nBuild a collection surface that discovers graph members from repository structure and resolves only a bounded visible window.\n\nMembership\n- direct node files except the collection root\n- root.node from each direct child directory\n- no recursive flattening\n\nState boundary\nScrolling may freely change temporary collection-view state, but browsing must not rewrite member graphs or authored collection structure.\n\nDelivery order\nContract to discovery to windowed surface to Collection Template to Ideas pilot.",
        "_classBinding": {
          "key": "markdown",
          "sourceRef": "github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/markdown.node-class.node",
          "ref": "github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/markdown.node-class.node",
